ng vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4AhtShhftLsQ7kNvwFIVTdt&_nc_oc=AdmyHhx0hx0ijEgF3ygYHfKpclNU2c9Qd3ZUxYz0tciiIR8098XWOVPxeR1S_33df6c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwZa9nNWaTNjVRIBLiZ_DFG6-EmG6leKIxD0TpoUdHLWA&oe=69B7E701"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GW0SMy7ZRZ4Q7kNvwEcI223&_nc_oc=AdmKnYmvtvsVPsE9OUc2r1xKyssy7ixj4P_Kwf1H3zIREISvagajLEg3SF5SkjOaKaA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwLb0VKu56QIhpHZ48S4241wq6obugGIxbGgaz_1xBUwQ&oe=69B7F466"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QZ3H6KyJjUgQ7kNvwERkmv4&_nc_oc=AdmXgcTERjLbLoCI1NvMxkmzfJ1Cgge4crBq1voZ2ClfOXeionLzs5kqDbOXW6IHtDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss